  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tuna mayo jacket potato is two things done well: a potato baked at high heat until the skin is properly crisp, and a simple tuna filling with enough mayonnaise to coat without becoming claggy. Both jobs are straightforward. The skin needs rubbing with oil and salt, then 75 minutes in a hot oven with no foil. The filling takes 5 minutes to mix while the potato bakes."
          }
        ]
      },
